        "description": "Second Agency is a modern, versatile, and responsive WordPress theme designed for companies and agencies. It is a minimal, lightweight, and customizer-based theme for creating beautiful, fast-loading, and accessible websites. The theme is SEO optimized, ensures fast loading times, and includes intuitive customization options, and beautiful typography. Second Agency is mobile-friendly and cross-browser compatible, looking great on all devices, computers, and screen sizes."
